    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "faq_a4",
      "label": "Answer 4",
      "default": "<p>A pocket-sized travel spray holding 5ml of the same fragrance you would find in the full-size bottle. That is roughly 60 sprays, about a month of daily wear, and it is small enough to be TSA friendly.</p>"
